    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d297">

                <pb facs="0274" n="262" xml:id="pg262"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.20/177: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dreyfus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-11-30T17:00:00+03:25">November 30,
                            1942—5 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 30—3:39 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>410. My 357, November 2 and Department’s instruction No. 155, November 5.
                    Schwarzkopf requests that the signing of agreement with Iran covering his
                    mission be expedited since he feels it will be difficult to establish his
                    organization and authority until his status is clearly defined.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dreyfus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
